## Getting started

Install the [Databricks CLI](https://docs.databricks.com/dev-tools/cli/install.html) and [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), then:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
make login       # databricks auth login --host {{ host }}
make install     # uv sync
make validate    # check the bundle
make deploy      # deploy to dev: resources are prefixed with [dev <you>]
make run         # run {{ name }}_job
```

Run `make help` to list every command. Deploy to production with `make deploy-prod`.

> `make destroy` deletes what the bundle deployed, **including the schema and its tables**.

